{"kp_id": "bc-006.kp0008", "video_id": "bc-006", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "黄连入血分味厚，石膏入气分味淡，清热路径不同。", "entity_ids": ["herb.huang_lian", "herb.shi_gao"], "chapter_id": "bc-006.c04", "evidence_quote": "一个入血分，一个入气氛", "seg_from": 785, "seg_to": 785, "start_s": 4347.174, "end_s": 4355.919, "citation": {"youtube_id": "jMoDrrLb6CQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jMoDrrLb6CQ&t=4347s", "series": "bc", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈精解 神農本草經之3 完整重製版 全68篇", "start_s": 4347.17, "end_s": 4355.92}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "气氛=气分", "source": "llm_read"}
